    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏnăger</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏnā^grus</span></b> ,
			i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄναγρος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a wild ass</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 2, 6, 3</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 37,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 44, 69, § 174</span></i>: 
